  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance, Analytical, Knowledge Management and Capacity Building Services to the Food Systems, Land Use and Restoration (FOLUR) Global Knowledge to Action Platform</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This global coordination project aims to support the overall GEF-7 Food Systems, Land Use and Restoration Impact Programme (FOLUR-IP) aiming to transform agriculture and food systems to be more inclusive, resilient and sustainable through contributing to transformational shifts in the use of environmentally sustainable practices and policies for priority global value chains to generate Global Environmental Benefits (GEBs).</narrative>
  </description>
